WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.540
The Trust Services Criteria are interconnected.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:08.520
A single control may support multiple criteria simultaneously.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.640
For example, access controls may support security, confidentiality, and privacy objectives.

4
00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:20.580
Logging may support security, processing integrity, accountability, and operational investigation.

5
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:30.780
Change management may support security, availability, and processing integrity by helping ensure system modifications are reviewed, tested, approved, and traceable.

6
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:37.060
Effective organizations often implement controls that contribute to multiple trust objectives at the same time.

7
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:41.240
This makes the criteria practical rather than isolated checklists.
